{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-26T23:51:56.646Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.1-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"f1c616668dfdb0e0cf9ed9c4","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.1-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/4","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-26T23:51:56.539Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Current-head CI exposed two retained refusal regressions: the new path read SDK usage before rejecting stale state, and malformed stored fences lost their repair diagnostic. Restored pure inspectItem admission before the effectful host read, then re-evaluate the fresh snapshot before the transaction. Stored malformed fences retain the established repair message. Added service-capable bound-client fallback coverage and explicit resource isolation checks. Restored targeted close/refusal/review suite passes 33/33, including 27 close tests. Removing only pure preflight fails the prepared-state regression once; removing only malformed-generation validation fails the repair-diagnostic regression once. Both probes exit 1 and restore exact source. Six close-related probes total 19 expected failures."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-26T23:51:56.646Z"}],"before_hash":"507cc90fd527998694abca2bd6eb46277c6af560e28d55edac0d7dd02fbbdbbd","after_hash":"3d18ff9799faccdb9821951e4354d7401a2856ebe9d12c1b868f4c5c28e8ce42","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"8e9049334d31a9b7